{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And you, be fruitful and multiply.</b> I do not want you to kill and diminish, but rather be fruitful and multiply. Another interpretation: when you execute judgment upon a murderer and put him to death, you will not thereby be diminished, but you shall be exceedingly fruitful and multiply. Another interpretation: this blessing was stated in this section twice — the first time to Adam, and the second time to the rest of creation."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:33.549598172Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}